# AGENTS

AGENTS.local.md
.pi/SYSTEM.md

# Estate (root AGENTS.md rule 39): the root is the six documents, LICENSE,
# ignore file, verb scripts and build manifests, and .kilo/ is gitignored.
.kilo/

# The *.bat rule above ignores every .bat in the tree. The estate expects the
# seven verb scripts at the project root, so they are re-included here; without
# these negations `git add build.bat` silently adds nothing.
!/build.bat
!/compile.bat
!/run.bat
!/test.bat
!/cli.bat
!/debug.bat
!/deploy.bat
reference/
build/
third_party/
test/
temp/
tmp/
tools/
reference/**

# Scratch and upstream trees: on disk, never in git (owner ruling 2026-11-11)
/temp/
/test/
/tool/
